<title>USA: PennFirst Bancorp board oks shr buyback.</title>
<headline>PennFirst Bancorp board oks shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ELLWOOD CITY, Pa. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PennFirst Bancorp Inc said its board authorized the repurchase of up to five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>PennFirst said the purchase will begin immediately and the stock will be held in treasury and used for stock options and other employee benefits plans, as well as for general corporate purposes or in connection with future acquistions.</p>
<p>The company said purchases will be makde on the open market or in private transactions from time to time.</p>
</text>
